[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m So, the expected values are:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A: 0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B: 0 (not reachable)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - C: 1 (reachable)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D: 0 (not reachable)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m This matches the observed values: A:0, B:0, C:1, D:0 ✅
