[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B is perturbed (value 0).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A is reachable from B (B->C, and C is reachable from B, but A is not reachable from B).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - C is reachable from B (B->C).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D is not reachable from B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m So, the expected values are:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A: 0 (not reachable from B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B: 0 (perturbed)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - C: 1 (reachable from B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D: 0 (not reachable from B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m This matches the observed values: A:1, B:0, C:1, D:0 ✅
