[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D is perturbed (value 0).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A is reachable from D (D->C, and C is reachable from D, but A is not reachable from D).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B is reachable from D (D->C, and C is reachable from D, but B is not reachable from D).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - C is reachable from D (D->C).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
