[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A: 0 (not reachable from D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B: 0 (not reachable from D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - C: 1 (reachable from D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D: 0 (perturbed)
