[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B is perturbed, so B:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A is a descendant of B (B->A), so A:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - C is a descendant of A (A->C), so C:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D is a descendant of A (A->D), so D:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
