[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - Perturb(A) sets A to 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A is the source of edges to B and D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B is a descendant of A, so B is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D is a descendant of A, so D is 1.
