[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - B is the source of edges to C and D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - C is a descendant of B, so C is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - D is a descendant of B, so D is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - A is not a descendant of B, so A is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m - So the result is: A:0, B:0, C:1, D:1 → matches the second observation.
