[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m But in the candidate graph, D is not a descendant of C. So D is not 1. This contradicts the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3622824)[0m 
