[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m Thus, **Perturb(A)** results in A:0, B:1, C:1, D:0 — which matches the observation **Perturb(A) -> A:0 B:0 C:1 D:0**. The observation has B:0, which is incorrect under this graph. So this observation is inconsistent.
