[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - C is a direct child of A (A → C), so C is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - D is a child of A (A → D) — but there is no such edge in the graph.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
