[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - B is a child of A (A → B), so B is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - C is a child of A (A → C), so C is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
