[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - A is perturbed → A:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - A → C (direct edge), so C is a downstream descendant of A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - C → D (direct edge), so D is a downstream descendant of C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - B and B→D, but B is not a descendant of A (no path from A to B), so B:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - Hence, the result is: A:0, B:0, C:1, D:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
