[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m Wait, but in the causal graph, B is the parent of C, and C is the parent of D. So **B is not a direct ancestor of A**, but **A is not a direct ancestor of B**. In terms of reachability, the graph is directed from A to B, B to C, C to D. So:
