[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m Wait, we need to find nodes that are **descendants** of the perturbed node (B) in the graph. So, perturbing B would make B = 0, and all nodes that are descendants of B (i.e., nodes reachable from B in the graph) would be 1.
