[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - A:1 (descendant of D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - B:1 (descendant of D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - C:0 (not a descendant of D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - So the result should be:  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   A:1, B:1, C:0, D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m But the perturbation observation says:  
