[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   - B: 1 (from C → B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   - C: 0 (perturbed)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   - D: 1 (from C → D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
