[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m     - B:1 (downstream of C)  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m     - A:1 (downstream of B)  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m     - D:0 (not downstream of C)  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   - But the given observation is:  
