[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 1. **Perturb(B)**:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m    - The perturbed node is B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m    - B is the source of edges: B->A and B->C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m    - From B, A and C are reachable.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m    - The perturbation of B causes A and C to be downstream of B.
