[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the semantics
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - A node is 0 unless it is a downstream descendant of the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - When a node is perturbed, it is set to 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - For a given perturbation, we assign 1 to all nodes that are downstream descendants of the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m ### Step 2: Check perturbation observations
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
