[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - Check which nodes are downstream descendants of B:  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   - B → A (so A is a downstream descendant)  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   - B → D (so D is a downstream descendant)  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m   - Other nodes: C is not a downstream descendant of B.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m - Therefore, the effect should be:  
