[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m      - So A:0 (but observed A:1). This is **inconsistent**.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m    → **Inconsistent**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3563078)[0m 
