[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m - Therefore, A:0, C:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m - Result: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:1 ✅ (matches the observation)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m 
