[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m **Step 1: Understand the perturbation rules**  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m - A node is 1 if it is a downstream descendant of the perturbed node in the graph.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m - A node is 0 otherwise.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m - A node is set to 0 when perturbed.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3700321)[0m ---
